	hydrology:Watercourse | im:Moderate         | hydrology:Seasonal    | earth:Lowland                                     | in (nca.ecology.ipcc:ColdTemperate, nca.ecology.ipcc:SubTropical, nca.ecology.ipcc:Tropical, nca.ecology.ipcc:WarmTemperate) | ecology:SubHumid                                  | nca.ecosystem.iucn:SeasonalLowlandRiver ,
